<section id="services" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Services from survey to support</h2>
    <p class="lede">Need something beyond our products? We build and support it end to end.</p>
    <div class="svc">
      <div><h3>Edge device installation</h3><p>Sensors, gateways, PLC, VFD, panels and wiring, installed and commissioned on site.</p></div>
      <div><h3>In-house training</h3><p>Hands-on industrial IoT and dashboard training with hardware kits and structured modules, as delivered for Toyota Indonesia.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Custom system integration</h3><p>Automation and data projects built around your existing machines, from retrofit to full control panels.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Maintenance and support</h3><p>Remote monitoring, preventive visits and SLA-based support after go-live.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="how">
      <h3 class="title">How we work</h3>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><h3>Site survey</h3><p>We map your machines, data points and network, then propose the right product or custom scope.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><h3>Pilot on one line</h3><p>Go live on a single line or area first, so you see results before committing further.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><h3>Scale up</h3><p>Roll out to more lines and sites on the same platform, with training and support for your team.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
